{
  "$comment": [
    "Repositories the API-docs regen will fetch, and nothing else.",
    "The regen is reachable by repository_dispatch, so an unlisted repo must be",
    "refused rather than cloned — otherwise the endpoint fetches and executes",
    "against whatever a caller names.",
    "Replaces the 17 hardcoded checkout steps in titanium-docs regen.yml, which",
    "cloned every one of these at full history on every dispatch."
  ],
